### Verificar saúde do worker
GET http://localhost:3000/api/worker/health

### Verificar status do worker
GET http://localhost:3000/api/worker/status

### Verificar estatísticas detalhadas do worker
GET http://localhost:3000/api/worker/stats

### Reiniciar navegador Playwright
POST http://localhost:3000/api/worker/restart-browser

### Executar busca de teste
POST http://localhost:3000/api/worker/test-search/PS5
